  "description": "Yeon, a lowly water serpent kept alive by the Azure Dragon’s divine power, finds herself carrying his child after a drunken night he cannot remember. Terrified that his pureblood ideals would mean certain death for her and her child, she hides the truth—until his suspicions begin to grow. \n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Notes:\n\\- Includes one extra chapter.\n\\- Part of Haewadal Studio's Saegya Danpyeonseon (색야 단편선) Collection.*",
